--TEST--
cms_field() needs the render context to print an entry field, whose locale it falls back from
--TEMPLATE--
{{ cms_field(entry, "title") }}
--DATA--
return ['entry' => $this->page(['en_US' => 'About us'])]
--EXCEPTION--
Twig\Error\RuntimeError: An exception has been thrown during the rendering of a template ("An entry's fields can only be printed from a template that has the render context in "_cms_render_context", such as a layout template") in "index.twig" at line 2.
